Inclusions: sensitivity to touch, numbness, hypaesthesia, hyperaesthesia, paraesethesia, tingling</ns2:description>
    <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#Class"/>
    <rdfs:label>Sensitivity to pressure</rdfs:label>
  </rdf:Description>
  <rdf:Description rdf:about="http://www.stiima.cnr.it/ICF-exc-coreset#d220">
    <rdfs:subClassOf rdf:resource="http://www.stiima.cnr.it/ICF-exc-coreset#Traumatic_Brain_Injury"/>
    <rdfs:subClassOf rdf:resource="http://www.stiima.cnr.it/ICF-exc-coreset#Activities_and_participation"/>
    <rdfs:subClassOf rdf:resource="http://www.stiima.cnr.it/RientraOnt3Merged#Hearing_Loss"/>
    <rdfs:subClassOf rdf:resource="http://www.stiima.cnr.it/ICF-exc-coreset#Vocational_Rehabilitation"/>
    <rdfs:subClassOf rdf:resource="http://www.stiima.cnr.it/ICF-exc-coreset#Stroke"/>
    <rdfs:label>Undertaking multiple tasks</rdfs:label>
    <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://www.stiima.cnr.it/ICF-exc-coreset#d220"/>
    <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#NamedIndividual"/>
    <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#Class"/>
    <ns2:description xml:lang="en">Carrying out simple or complex and coordinated actions as components of multiple, integrated and complex tasks in sequence or simultaneously.
Inclusions: undertaking multiple tasks; completing multiple tasks; undertaking multiple tasks independently and in a group

Exclusions: acquiring skills (d155); solving problems (d175); making decisions (d177); undertaking a single task (d210)</ns2:description>
    <ns2:descrizioneITA>Compiere delle azioni semplici o complesse e coordinate, come componenti di compiti articolati, integrati e complessi in sequenza o simultaneamente.

Inclusioni: intraprendere compiti articolati; portare a termine compiti articolati; intraprendere compiti articolati autonomamente o in gruppo

Esclusioni: acquisizione di abilitÃ  (d155); risoluzione di problemi (d175); prendere decisioni (d177); intraprendere un compito singolo (d210)</ns2:descrizioneITA>
    <ns2:nomeIta>Intraprendere compiti articolati</ns2:nomeIta>
  </rdf:Description>
