  </rdf:Description>
  <rdf:Description rdf:about="http://www.stiima.cnr.it/ICF-exc-coreset#b310">
    <ns2:description>Functions of the production of various sounds by the passage of air through the larynx.
Inclusions: functions of production and quality of voice; functions of phonation, pitch, loudness and other qualities of voice; impairments such as aphonia, dysphonia, hoarseness, hypernasality and hyponasality
Exclusions: mental functions of language (b167); articulation functions (b320); alternative vocalization functions (b340)</ns2:description>
    <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://www.stiima.cnr.it/ICF-exc-coreset#b310"/>
    <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#Class"/>
