    <ns2:description>Sensations associated with the muscles or muscle groups of the body and their movement.
Inclusions: sensations of muscle stiffness and tightness of muscles, muscle spasm or constriction, and heaviness of muscles
Exclusions: sensation of pain (b280)</ns2:description>
