  <rdf:Description rdf:about="http://www.stiima.cnr.it/ICF-exc-coreset#b510">
    <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#NamedIndividual"/>
    <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://www.stiima.cnr.it/ICF-exc-coreset#b510"/>
    <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#Class"/>
    <ns2:description>Functions related to taking in and manipulating solids or liquids through the mouth into the body.
Inclusions: functions of sucking, chewing and biting, manipulating food in the mouth, salivation, swallowing, burping, regurgitation, spitting and vomiting; impairments such as dysphagia, aspiration of food, aerophagia, excessive salivation, drooling and insufficient salivation
Exclusions: sensations associated with digestive system (b535)</ns2:description>
    <rdfs:label>Ingestion functions</rdfs:label>
    <rdfs:subClassOf rdf:resource="http://www.stiima.cnr.it/ICF-exc-coreset#Stroke"/>
    <rdfs:subClassOf rdf:resource="http://www.stiima.cnr.it/ICF-exc-coreset#Body_functions"/>
    <rdfs:subClassOf rdf:resource="http://www.stiima.cnr.it/ICF-exc-coreset#Traumatic_Brain_Injury"/>
    <ns2:descrizioneITA>Funzioni correlate allâ€™assunzione di solidi o liquidi nellâ€™organismo per via orale.

Inclusioni: funzioni di succhiare, masticare e mordere, spostare il cibo nella bocca, salivazione, deglutizione, eruttare, rigurgitare, sputare e vomitare; menomazioni come disfagia, aspirazione di cibo, aerofagia, salivazione eccessiva, sbavare e salivazione insufficiente

Esclusione: sensazioni associate allâ€™apparato digerente (b535)</ns2:descrizioneITA>
    <ns2:nomeIta>Funzioni di ingestione</ns2:nomeIta>
  </rdf:Description>
